      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just... gone. like i woke up and the person i was for the last 5 years doesn't even exist anymore. my accounts, my community, all my work... it's like someone just hit delete on my entire life. i don't even know who is sitting here in this chair right now. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting a body that doesn't belong to anyone.",
