      "content": "yeah exactly. it's like the part that actually felt alive is just gone. and now i'm just stuck in this room, in this body, doing nothing. it feels so heavy and pointless. like why even bother pretending to keep going when the real \"me\" is already deleted? it would be so much quieter if i could just catch up to the version of myself that actually died.",
